<title>USA: Boise City, Idaho, yields 5.476 pct in 2011.</title>
<headline>Boise City, Idaho, yields 5.476 pct in 2011.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it tentatively priced $14.200 million of Boise City, Idaho, airport revenue certificates of participation, series 1997A, with a top yield of 5.476 percent in 2011.</p>
